SIGNAL-WASM

@getmaapp/signal-wasm (https://github.com/getmaapp/signal-wasm), AGPL-3.0-only: libsignal compiled
to WebAssembly, providing sessions, the Double Ratchet, prekeys and sender keys. It is a dependency
installed from npm, not copied into this repository.


RUST CRATES IN THE PREBUILT WEBASSEMBLY

src/vendor/signal-tls and src/vendor/signal-sealed are compiled together with third-party crates,
among them rustls and ring (TLS), wasm-bindgen and js-sys (JavaScript bindings), the RustCrypto
crates, curve25519-dalek, libcrux (Cryspen) and hpke-rs. THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt lists every crate
with its license and the license files it ships.
